ITEM.P:
Declare that, by not establishing a programme of measures to ensure strict protection of the speciesCricetus cricetus(the European Hamster), the French Republic has failed to fulfil its obligations under Article 12(1)(d) of Directive 92/43/EEC of21 May 1992on the conservation of natural habitats and of wild fauna and flora


                OJ 1992 L 206, p. 7

            ;
